    "novelty_claim": "This is the first crosscoder-based mechanistic analysis of PRM paradigm differences with a falsification-validated feature taxonomy. We are NOT claiming to be the first to use crosscoders for model comparison (Lindsey et al. 2024, Shi et al. 2604.25011). Our novelty is the specific application to PRM verification mechanisms, the error-pattern vs. error-explanation taxonomy, the explicit falsification protocol, and the causal validation via feature steering -- none of which appear in prior crosscoder work. Shi et al. (2604.25011) study why RL generalizes; we study how PRMs verify."
